{"product_id":"the-handmaids-tale","title":"The Handmaid's Tale","description":"\u003cp\u003eOffred is a Handmaid in the Republic of Gilead. She has only one function: to breed. If she deviates, she will, like dissenters, be hanged at the wall or sent out to die slowly of radiation sickness. But even a repressive state cannot obliterate desire - neither Offred's nor that of the two men on which her future hangs. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:130 x 196  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Margaret Atwood \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780099511663 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 324\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42594309046425,"sku":"12RF9780099511663","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/e2d17411ed9e66a3f737eaf76dec3519.jpg?v=1727970646","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-handmaids-tale","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}